# Portfolio companion app

Native Expo / React Native client for the Next.js 16 site at `~/projects/my-portfolio`.

**Tabs (fixed):** Home · Blogs · Experience · Contact · Settings. About, Projects, Project detail, Skills, Privacy live **only** in the Home stack — never as tabs. Chat is a root-level modal reached via the global `ChatFab`, not a tab.

**Status:** M0–M2 landed. **M3 (static screens) is next.** Work one phase at a time; do not start M*n+1* until M*n*'s bold **Exit:** in `docs/00-roadmap.md` is true. If a task doesn't map to a phase, say so before starting.

## Stack

Bun 1.3 · Expo SDK 57 · RN 0.86.2 · React 19.2.3 · expo-router 57 (`NativeTabs`) · New Architecture + React Compiler · TypeScript 6 (`@/*` → `src/*`) · typed theme + `StyleSheet.create` — **no NativeWind** (D3) · Reanimated 4 · bundled static TS (D2) · AI SDK 7 `useChat` over `expo/fetch` (D5).

```bash
bun install && bun run start   # ios / android / lint / sync-content
bunx tsc --noEmit && bun test
```

## Definition of done

Phase **Exit:** true · focused tests · `bun run lint` and `bunx tsc --noEmit` pass · iOS **and** Android for layout/nav/keyboard/streaming/safe-area · both colour schemes + reduced motion · update `docs/` in the same change if behaviour drifts · review the diff for secrets and unrelated edits.
